# SaansSetu AI Environment Configuration
# SaansSetu AI is 100% free, self-contained, and fully functional without requiring ANY paid API keys or external subscriptions.
# Live atmospheric data is ingested via Open-Meteo European CAMS models (open-access).
# The context-aware bilingual environmental intelligence engine runs deterministically on-device/in-process.

# Optional: Google Gemini API key (if you wish to enable experimental LLM mode; defaults to deterministic engine if unset)
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Public App URL (Default: http://localhost:3000)
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
